        },
        "message": "init writes pyproject.toml; ruff and truewire-core become dependencies\n\n- truewire init now writes a pyproject.toml (src layout, depends on\n  truewire-core) so pip install -e . makes the generated client importable,\n  as the README quickstart shows.\n- ruff moves from the dev extra to the runtime dependencies so generated\n  files are always formatted.\n- truewire depends on truewire-core: generation imports the target package,\n  which imports the runtime.\n- Add a root .gitignore.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VzFz3bSjxtpXjWmaffrexN",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "bbab3896d5ed79f8a2d894da660f9548b9816283",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/truewire-dev/truewire/git/trees/bbab3896d5ed79f8a2d894da660f9548b9816283"
        },
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/truewire-dev/truewire/git/commits/9d91c4085cb5886b6d8e962f286c060d12201dd6",
        "comment_count": 0,
        "verification": {
          "verified": false,
          "reason": "unknown_key",
