          "payload": "tree bbab3896d5ed79f8a2d894da660f9548b9816283\nparent 66d76e373ca8f8731d21b75e4041c0aaa8a99b84\nauthor Truewire CEO <marci.clabas@gmail.com> 1788773179 +0000\ncommitter Truewire CEO <marci.clabas@gmail.com> 1788773179 +0000\n\ninit writes pyproject.toml; ruff and truewire-core become dependencies\n\n- truewire init now writes a pyproject.toml (src layout, depends on\n  truewire-core) so pip install -e . makes the generated client importable,\n  as the README quickstart shows.\n- ruff moves from the dev extra to the runtime dependencies so generated\n  files are always formatted.\n- truewire depends on truewire-core: generation imports the target package,\n  which imports the runtime.\n- Add a root .gitignore.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VzFz3bSjxtpXjWmaffrexN\n",
